{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9a90265eb486a171","name":"Overload Switch","source":{"id":"source:reference-9a90265eb486a171","title":"Overload Switch","revision":19726,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:30:04Z","sha256":"0fabf95bf52f55ef152c44302e903304fee5e86afd2d67102443e1a7bb919ee0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19726","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Overload%20Switch&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9a90265eb486a171","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 250\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Overload Switch allows any Energy weapon to build a feedback loop that causes it to explode. When activated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", the weapon becomes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improvised Thrown Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improvised_Thrown_Weapon"}," (-5 penalty on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," roll) with a 2-square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"},". A weapon whose size is two or more steps greater than yours (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," using an ",{"tag":"a","children":["E-Web Repeating Blaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/E-Web_Repeating_Blaster","referenceId":"reference:3bac50ec8614d1fb"},") cannot be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown"},", so it will instead detonate at the end of your turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The overloaded weapon deals Energy damage equal to double its normal damage dice; for example, an overloaded ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"}," deals 6d6 points of Energy damage. Once the Overload Switch is used, the weapon is destroyed. This modification cannot be added to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"},", or other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Explosives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Explosives"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
